  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Program for an Immediate Response to the Earthquake in Ecuador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Emergencia para Respuesta Inmediata por el terremoto en Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es colaborar con los esfuerzos del gobierno de Ecuador para restaurar servicios bsicos afectados por el terremoto ocurrido en abril 016.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective program is to collaborate with the the government&apos;s efforts to restore basic services affected by the earthquake in Ecuador in april 2016.</narrative>
  </description>
